{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "F1",
      "statement": "Bounded replay run:5ce89f521e5e (50,000 events, 3/3 jobs completed, clink exit status 0, not cancelled; parameters: fan-in needs at least 5 distinct senders inside a 3,600,000 ms window, onward max gap 1,800,000 ms). It holds 50,000 transfers, 691 onward links, 12,072 accounts, 12,321 devices and 6 fan-in alerts. Everything below holds only for this dataset as this run processed it.",
      "claim_ids": [
        "C-cnt-alerts",
        "C-cnt-transfers",
        "C-cnt-links",
        "C-cnt-accounts",
        "C-cnt-devices"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F2",
      "statement": "fan_in:A-37573:1794823200000: 7 senders, 7 transfers, 379,500 total. All 7 contributing transfers were passed on. Chains run up to 4 onward links, A-37573 -> A-38045 -> A-93288 -> A-63022 -> A-54215, in two waves (T003168/T003182/T003201/T003222 and T003391/T003416/T003433/T003454). The money comes to rest only at A-54215. Device D-45880 sent from all four sending accounts on the route (A-37573, A-38045, A-93288, A-63022), and the dataset records no other sender using it.",
      "claim_ids": [
        "C-ind-37573",
        "C-path-37573a",
        "C-path-37573b",
        "C-reach-37573",
        "C-dev-45880",
        "C-ev-T003168",
        "C-ev-T003222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F3",
      "statement": "fan_in:A-83577:1795057200000: 8 senders, 8 transfers, 174,500 total. All 8 contributing transfers feed T022572. The single chain has 5 onward links, the deepest of any alert: A-83577 -> A-56768 -> A-83094 -> A-43725 -> A-14799 -> A-39382. Money comes to rest at A-39382. Device D-40018 sent from two route accounts that are not adjacent on the route, A-83094 (T022609) and A-14799 (T022649). It was also used by A-34114, which is not on the route (T038409).",
      "claim_ids": [
        "C-ind-83577",
        "C-path-83577",
        "C-reach-83577",
        "C-dev-40018-route",
        "C-dev-40018-all",
        "C-ev-T022609",
        "C-ev-T022649",
        "C-ev-T038409"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F4",
      "statement": "fan_in:A-10859:1794924000000: 6 senders, 6 transfers, 204,000 total. All 6 contributing transfers were passed on to A-78340 (T011583, T011670). The route then splits. At most 3 onward links lead to A-92332 via A-75793 (T011600, T011628). A 2-link branch leads to A-85287 (T011695). There are two resting accounts, A-92332 and A-85287. Device D-79802 sent from both A-10859 and A-78340, the first two accounts on the route. No other account in the dataset used it.",
      "claim_ids": [
        "C-ind-10859",
        "C-path-10859a",
        "C-path-10859b",
        "C-reach-10859",
        "C-dev-79802",
        "C-ev-T011583",
        "C-ev-T011600"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F5",
      "statement": "fan_in:A-20636:1795190400000: 6 senders, 6 transfers, 36,000 total. 5 of the 6 contributing transfers feed one 1-link hop, T033506 (30,000 to A-36729), where the money comes to rest. T033316 was not passed on. No device was used by two route accounts. A-36729's device D-30793 was also used by A-69026, which is not on the route.",
