    {
      "id": "F6",
      "statement": "fan_in:A-85921:1794855600000: 6 senders, 6 transfers of exactly 2,500 each, 15,000 total. 4 of the contributing transfers feed one 1-link hop, T005888 (9,500 to A-10758), where the money comes to rest. T005934 and T005978 were not passed on. No device was used by two route accounts.",
