    {
      "id": "F7",
      "statement": "fan_in:A-28137:1795003200000: 7 senders, 7 transfers, 29,500 total. None of its 7 contributing transfers was passed on (max depth 0, no resting account, route is only A-28137). A-28137 does have a later outgoing transfer, T018852 at 1795013700000. That is about 2 h after the last contribution, beyond the 30-min onward gap, so it is not an onward link. No device is shared on the route.",
